        <Options>
            <Main applyHouseholdOperatingConditions="false" applyReducedOperatingConditions="false" atypicalElectricalLoads="false" waterConservation="false" referenceHouse="false">
                <Vermiculite code="3">
                    <English>No Vermiculite</English>
                    <French>Pas de Vermiculite</French>
                </Vermiculite>
            </Main>
            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>Replace seals around doors and windows, eliminate leakage at rim joists, and install gaskets on outlets.</airSeal>
                <mainWalls>Add R20 insulation to the to be elligible for a rebate of  $2.5/square foot of insulation.</mainWalls>
                <ceilings>Adding insulation in the ceiling will improve the performance of the house but will not be elligible for rebates due to the limited heel height. This is a lower priority item because there is already R40 in the ceiling.</ceilings>
                <exposedFloors>Add R20 to the exposed floor under the kitchen to be elligible for a rebate of  $2.5/square foot of insulation.</exposedFloors>
                <foundation>Add R20 insulation to the walls to be elligible for a rebate of  $2.5/square foot. Also install at least R10 on the floor to satisfy city of Whitehorse building by laws. Install R20 on the floor to be elligible for a rebate.</foundation>
                <windows>Upgrade windows to Argon filled, triple pane windows with two low E coatings to be elligible for a rebate of $100 per window</windows>
                <VentilationSystem>The existing exhaust only ventilation system is near the end of its expected life. Consider replacing it with an HRV.</VentilationSystem>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
